        "official_en_sha256": "d0007897260af35125f94ba003ccdd1b4ffe687104f4a41e677f79b835b02367"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "それでアイリーンは軍に関わるのをやめた。\r\n怪我人が出たことに責任を感じたんだろうな。",
        "official_en": "She left us after that. I imagine the guilt was simply too much to bear.",
        "real_en": "Aileen stopped working with the military after that. I guess she felt responsible for the injuries."
      },
