        "official_en_sha256": "00a82c4e6127998b120e325e9a4b391875f70fab654fbc718cdbda7c7f0cdb74"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "もう数年前になるか。\r\nアイリーンは軍の開発部門に協力していて、\r\nこれまでにない大火力の武器を作ったんだ。",
        "official_en": "Was a few years back, that. She’d agreed to help the army with research, and created a weapon with unprecedented firepower.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
