        "official_en_sha256": "ec4319d425aaef1f42e36b46cff3ebb75a988e6d0edace57665e37d72a0a1d29"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "上層部は軍に残ってほしいと頼んだらしいが……。\r\n持ち主の顔が見えない武器を作ることは\r\nもうやらないと言って断ったらしい。",
        "official_en": "The higher-ups still asked her to stay. But she refused to help them, saying she won’t make weapons that can kill indiscriminately.",
        "real_en": "I hear the higher-ups asked her to stay, but she refused. She said she'd never again make weapons without knowing the faces of those who would use them."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
