        "official_en_sha256": "682aa46f843d6a219eafbf8aa9831ed3caeb204175a4a715dd115ae26316347a"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "使用者が武器を使いこなすことができず、\r\n味方を巻き込んで重傷を負わせてしまったんだ。",
        "official_en": "The operator couldn’t get a handle on it. It led to a friendly fire incident, causing grievous wounds.",
        "real_en": "The person using it couldn't control the weapon and ended up seriously injuring their own allies."
